<title>NEW ZEALAND: TENNIS-BELLSOUTH OPEN HIT BY RAIN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BELLSOUTH OPEN HIT BY RAIN.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rain prevented any play on Friday in the BellSouth Open tennis tournament. Organisers stated that they hope to play the quarter-finals and semifinals on Saturday.</p>
</text>
